      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Weapons made from a mantis are ten times sharper than iron and it's
          as light as a feather. Moreover, their skulls can be turned into armour
          which can withstand any fire attacks.\r"
        type: 0
