        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I used to be an apprentice for a weapon maker back in Haden. Well,
          until we moved here in Morden. Now all I do is just appraise weapons if
          I\u2019m being honest with you is pretty boring. I miss the smell of the
          iron when it's melting.\r"
